<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Daphne" data-copy-zh="Daphne">Daphne</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Recruit Daphne, prepare her room, and unlock her personal visits and shared corridor events." data-copy-zh="为 Daphne 准备住处，完成招募，再逐步开放个人拜访与走廊共同事件。">Recruit Daphne, prepare her room, and unlock her personal visits and shared corridor events.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Daphne at a glance</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Meet and recruit Daphne</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Personal progress and shared stories</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Visits and daily care</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If you get stuck</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">先认识 Daphne</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">初次见面与招募</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">相处与走廊事件</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">日常拜访与照料</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查这些地方</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><h2>Daphne at a glance</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Daphne — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/daphne.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Daphne — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/daphne.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Daphne — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Daphne is a gentle dryad from the <strong>Overgrown Depths</strong>. You first meet her in the normal dungeon, then can invite her to a prepared room at the Rose &amp; Thorn. Her personal progress comes from daily visits and eighteen shared corridor events with other residents.</p><p>Her affection and <strong>Tamed</strong> meter have separate roles. Affection opens personal visits and stories; Tamed belongs to resident care and daily work.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Meet and recruit Daphne</h2><ol><li>Reach the normal <strong>Ancient Catacombs, Floors 31–35</strong>, where Daphne can appear in ordinary battles. Prepare for sleep and magic; she is vulnerable to Fire.</li><li>Build the <strong>Cell Corridor</strong> and leave an <strong>already built, vacant cell beyond Cell 1</strong> ready at the Rose &amp; Thorn. Cell 1 is reserved for Bobo.</li><li>Defeat Daphne five times. Recruitment offers can begin from the <strong>sixth victory</strong>, with better chances as you continue winning or improve Taming.</li><li>When offered <strong>Room to Grow</strong>, accept to recruit her. If there is no room, prepare a vacant cell and try again on a later victory. Accepting gives her a room and 10 affection.</li></ol><details><summary>Need a reliable encounter location?</summary><p>After building the Cell Corridor, the hidden wall route on <strong>Floor 33</strong> leads to Daphne while she is unrecruited. Its map coordinate is <strong>(2, 10)</strong>, counting the upper-left tile as (0, 0). This is a normal-dungeon route.</p></details><p>After recruitment, visit her <strong>assigned cell from the Cell Corridor</strong>. She is there all day, every day. Use the room she received; her room number can differ between saves.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Personal progress and shared stories</h2><p>Start with conversation, then add the garden, quiet-company and kiss visits as their relationship stages open. Daphne’s preferred stats are <strong>Mystic 60, Charm 55 and Taming 50</strong>; <strong>Empathy</strong> improves her affection gains.</p><p>Her eighteen shared events start automatically in the <strong>Cell Corridor</strong>. Everyone named in a row must already live at the Rose &amp; Thorn and reach the listed stage. Return to the corridor after raising the relationships or finishing a prerequisite event. These events have no separate time-of-day window.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Corridor event</th><th scope="col">Minimum relationship stages</th><th scope="col">Earlier events needed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Price of a Flower</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Bobo — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Gentler Watch</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Myriss — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Something of Her Own</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Jelly — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What Still Grows</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Melanthe — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Strong Enough to Rest</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Bessie — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Leave Room for Roots</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Arachne — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Compliments, Wholesale</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Close Friend (200); Bobo — Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">The Price of a Flower</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Noise Worth Keeping</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Close Friend (200); Myriss — Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">A Gentler Watch</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Trouble with Being Daphne</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Close Friend (200); Jelly — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">Something of Her Own</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Ordinary Afternoon</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Close Friend (200); Melanthe — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">What Still Grows</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Delicate Negotiation</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Crush (400); Bessie — Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">Strong Enough to Rest</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unfinished Gift</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Romantic (800); Arachne — Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">Leave Room for Roots</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">House Rules, Apparently</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Known (25); Bobo — Known (25); Jelly — Known (25)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Quiet Competition</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Acquaintance (50); Myriss — Acquaintance (50); Bessie — Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">None</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Properly Improper</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Friend (100); Melanthe — Friend (100); Arachne — Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">What Still Grows<br/>Leave Room for Roots</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Three Terrible Liars</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Close Friend (200); Bobo — Close Friend (200); Myriss — Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">The Price of a Flower<br/>A Gentler Watch</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Worst Advice Club</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Crush (400); Jelly — Close Friend (200); Arachne — Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">Something of Her Own<br/>Leave Room for Roots</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Audience Required</th><td data-label="Minimum relationship stages">Daphne — Intimate (1600); Melanthe — Romantic (800); Bessie — Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Earlier events needed">What Still Grows<br/>Strong Enough to Rest<br/>A Delicate Negotiation</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each shared event gives 5 base affection to each participating character, with further choice rewards. The table gives the steps needed to find the events and leaves their conversations for the game.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Visits and daily care</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Unlock</th><th scope="col">Time</th><th scope="col">Base affection / other gain</th><th scope="col">Daily allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Daphne</th><td data-label="Unlock">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Time">15 min</td><td data-label="Base affection / other gain">1</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tend Her Garden</th><td data-label="Unlock">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Time">30 min</td><td data-label="Base affection / other gain">5 affection; +5 Tamed</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Share Her Quiet</th><td data-label="Unlock">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Time">30 min</td><td data-label="Base affection / other gain">10 affection; +5 Tamed</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kiss Daphne</th><td data-label="Unlock">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Time">30 min</td><td data-label="Base affection / other gain">15 affection; +5 Tamed</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">1</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each personal action has its own allowance. Garden, quiet-company and kiss visits add Tamed progress while leaving the separate daily taming visit available. Their Tamed gain is subject to the usual meter cap.</p><p>For resident care, use <strong>Tame Monsters</strong> at the Cell Corridor. The daily session includes feeding, tools, teaching and the training options you have unlocked. Daphne starts with <strong>50 Tamed</strong>, uses <strong>3 Food</strong> for a feeding, and normally loses <strong>4 Tamed per game day</strong>. Daily work requires at least <strong>30 Tamed</strong>. Use the management screen to monitor her condition and experience as well as her affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>If you get stuck</h2><dl><dt><strong>I have defeated her five times, but cannot recruit her.</strong></dt><dd>The first offer is possible after the sixth victory. Keep a built vacant cell ready and continue winning; higher Taming helps.</dd><dt><strong>A successful encounter says there is no room.</strong></dt><dd>Use an already built, vacant cell beyond reserved Cell 1; current construction offers Cells 2–7. Having a corridor, an unbuilt cell, or only Cell 1 does not provide a usable vacancy.</dd><dt><strong>My Infinity victories did not help.</strong></dt><dd>Return to normal Floors 31–35. Infinity battles do not add recruitment victories or offer recruitment.</dd><dt><strong>Daphne disappeared from dungeon encounters.</strong></dt><dd>After recruiting her, look in her assigned room at the Rose &amp; Thorn.</dd><dt><strong>A corridor event will not start.</strong></dt><dd>Check every participant’s relationship stage and residence, then the earlier events in the table. Enter the corridor itself rather than remaining in Daphne’s room.</dd><dt><strong>Her personal visit is available, but daily taming is greyed out.</strong></dt><dd>Daily taming is a separate allowance. Check whether you used it today or she is resting; continue ordinary personal visits when their own requirements are met.</dd></dl></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon — access, exploration and battle preparation</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn — construction and monster residents</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">Daily work, condition and Tamed</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and affection bonuses</a></li><li><a href="characters.html">Characters — find the other corridor residents</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><h2>先认识 Daphne</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Daphne 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/daphne.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Daphne 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/daphne.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Daphne 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Daphne 是来自<strong>蔓生深层</strong>的温柔树精。你会先在普通地下城中遇到她，再邀请她住进玫瑰与荆棘准备好的房间。她的个人内容包括日常拜访，以及与其他住客共同出现的十八段走廊事件。</p><p>推进时要分别留意<strong>好感</strong>和<strong>驯服度</strong>：好感开放个人互动与事件，驯服度则关系到日常照料和工作。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>初次见面与招募</h2><ol><li>前往普通<strong>古老地下墓穴第 31–35 层</strong>。Daphne 会出现在这个区域的普通战斗中。她擅长睡眠与魔法，可以准备相应应对手段；火属性是她的弱点。</li><li>在玫瑰与荆棘建好<strong>牢房走廊</strong>，并预留一间<strong>1 号之外、已经建成且无人入住的牢房</strong>。1 号牢房留给 Bobo。</li><li>击败 Daphne 五次后，<strong>从第六次胜利起</strong>有机会出现招募事件。继续获胜、提高驯服属性，都能增加成功机会。</li><li>出现<strong>《留出成长的空间》</strong>时，选择接受即可邀请她入住，并获得 10 点好感。若提示没有房间，先建好空房，再通过后续胜利重新尝试。</li></ol><details><summary>想找一个更稳定的相遇地点？</summary><p>建好牢房走廊后，<strong>第 33 层</strong>的隐藏墙壁路线可以让你再次遇到尚未招募的 Daphne。位置为地图坐标<strong>（2，10）</strong>，以左上角格子为（0，0）。这条路线位于普通地下城中。</p></details><p>入住后，从<strong>牢房走廊进入分配给她的房间</strong>即可拜访，她每天全天都在。不同存档分配到的房间号可能不同。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>相处与走廊事件</h2><p>先从交谈开始，随着关系提升，再加入打理花园、安静陪伴与亲吻。她偏好的属性是<strong>神秘 60、魅力 55、驯服 50</strong>，学会<strong>共情</strong>也能提高好感收益。</p><p>十八段共同事件都会在<strong>牢房走廊</strong>自动开始。表中提到的每位角色都要先入住玫瑰与荆棘，并达到相应关系阶段。提升好感或完成前置事件后，再次进入走廊即可检查后续；这些事件没有额外的时段要求。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">走廊事件</th><th scope="col">所需最低关系阶段</th><th scope="col">需要先完成</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">一朵花的价钱</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Bobo：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更温柔的守望</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Myriss：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">属于她自己的东西</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Jelly：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">仍在生长的事物</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Melanthe：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">坚强，也可以休息</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Bessie：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">给树根留点空间</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Arachne：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">赞美，批发价</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Bobo：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">一朵花的价钱</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">值得留下的声响</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Myriss：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">更温柔的守望</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学着当Daphne的烦恼</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Jelly：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">属于她自己的东西</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个平常的下午</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Melanthe：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">仍在生长的事物</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一场温柔的协商</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：迷恋（Crush，400）；Bessie：迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">坚强，也可以休息</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">尚未送出的礼物</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：浪漫感（Romantic，800）；Arachne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">给树根留点空间</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">据说，这就是家规</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：已知（Known，25）；Bobo：已知（Known，25）；Jelly：已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安静比赛</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：相识（Acquaintance，50）；Myriss：相识（Acquaintance，50）；Bessie：相识（Acquaintance，50）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">无</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不合规矩的好规矩</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：朋友（Friend，100）；Melanthe：朋友（Friend，100）；Arachne：朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">仍在生长的事物<br/>给树根留点空间</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">三个不会撒谎的人</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Bobo：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Myriss：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">一朵花的价钱<br/>更温柔的守望</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">馊主意俱乐部</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：迷恋（Crush，400）；Jelly：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；Arachne：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">属于她自己的东西<br/>给树根留点空间</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不需要观众</th><td data-label="所需最低关系阶段">Daphne：亲密（Intimate，1600）；Melanthe：浪漫感（Romantic，800）；Bessie：浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="需要先完成">仍在生长的事物<br/>坚强，也可以休息<br/>一场温柔的协商</td></tr></tbody></table><p>每段共同事件会给参与者各 5 点基础好感，选择还可能带来额外收益。上表只说明如何遇到这些事件，具体对话留到游戏中体验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>日常拜访与照料</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">开放阶段</th><th scope="col">时间</th><th scope="col">基础好感／其他收益</th><th scope="col">每日次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Daphne聊天</th><td data-label="开放阶段">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="时间">15 分钟</td><td data-label="基础好感／其他收益">1</td><td data-label="每日次数">3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">打理她的花园</th><td data-label="开放阶段">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="时间">30 分钟</td><td data-label="基础好感／其他收益">5 好感；驯服度 +5</td><td data-label="每日次数">1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">陪她享受宁静</th><td data-label="开放阶段">朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="时间">30 分钟</td><td data-label="基础好感／其他收益">10 好感；驯服度 +5</td><td data-label="每日次数">1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲吻Daphne</th><td data-label="开放阶段">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="时间">30 分钟</td><td data-label="基础好感／其他收益">15 好感；驯服度 +5</td><td data-label="每日次数">1</td></tr></tbody></table><p>四种个人行动的每日次数分别计算。打理花园、安静陪伴和亲吻都会提高驯服度，仍然可以在同一天另行进行驯服拜访；增加量受到通常的驯服度上限限制。</p><p>需要照料住客时，在牢房走廊选择<strong>「驯服怪物」</strong>，进行喂食、使用工具、教导或已解锁的训练。Daphne 入住时有<strong>50 驯服度</strong>，每次喂食消耗<strong>3 食物</strong>，通常每个游戏日减少<strong>4 驯服度</strong>；日常工作至少需要<strong>30 驯服度</strong>。除了好感，也要在管理界面留意她的状态与经验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查这些地方</h2><dl><dt><strong>已经打赢五次，为什么还不能招募？</strong></dt><dd>最早要从第六次胜利起才有机会。预留建好的空房，继续尝试；提高驯服属性也会有帮助。</dd><dt><strong>事件提示没有地方入住。</strong></dt><dd>需要 1 号之外、已经建成且无人入住的牢房；当前可建造的是 2–7 号。只有走廊、尚未建成的房间或 1 号牢房，都不满足空房条件。</dd><dt><strong>在无限地下城打赢很多次，还是没有进展。</strong></dt><dd>回到普通地下城第 31–35 层。无限地下城的胜利不累计招募次数，也不会提供招募机会。</dd><dt><strong>地下城里找不到 Daphne 了。</strong></dt><dd>已经招募后，请到玫瑰与荆棘分配给她的房间拜访。</dd><dt><strong>走廊事件没有出现。</strong></dt><dd>检查所有参与者是否已经入住、关系是否达标，以及前置事件是否完成。满足条件后，进入牢房走廊本身，不要只停留在 Daphne 的房间里。</dd><dt><strong>还能个人拜访，驯服选项却是灰色。</strong></dt><dd>两类拜访的次数分别计算。确认今天是否已经进行过驯服，或她是否正在休息；个人拜访只要满足自己的条件，仍可继续。</dd></dl></section>
